Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: m6A Site Prediction from Sequence and Genomic Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Keyue", family = "Lei",
           email = "keyue.lei24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts N6-methyladenosine (m6A) sites from RNA sequence and
    genomic features using a bundled random forest classifier. The package
    provides a batch prediction function for a feature table and a
    convenience function for a single candidate site, each returning the
    predicted m6A probability and a Positive/Negative status.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    randomForest,
    stats
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
